    ],
    "level": 3,
    "canonicalUrl": "https://quasar.dev/vue-components/slider#with-inner-min-max",
    "content": "Sometimes you need to restrict the model value to an interval inside of the track's length. For this purpose, use `inner-min` and `inner-max` props. First prop needs to be higher or equal to `min` prop while the latter needs to be lower or equal to the `max` prop.\n\nExample: Inner min/max (InnerMinMax.vue)",
